					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "SAMPLE TEXTURE\n\nThe Sample Texture node reads a pixel or a kernel of pixels from a texture and returns the color.\nIn case of a radius larger than 1, an average color is calculated.\n\nIn the node panel you will find the option to switch between pixel space and normalized space."
					}
				},
